# Copy to .env.local to override settings locally (.env* files are gitignored).
#
# The Firebase web config is committed in src/lib/firebase.ts; it identifies
# the project and is not a secret. Access is enforced by firestore.rules.

# "true" points Auth and Firestore at the local emulators started with
# `npm run emulators` (or use `npm run dev:emulators`, which sets this for you).
VITE_USE_EMULATORS="false"
